OL,3,GNEWSAWhy a convicted #33m tax fraudster
OL,4,Ais living it up in Dubai
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the UK's most prolific
OL,7,Ffraudsters, described by a judge as a
OL,8,F"breathtakingly arrogant" and "totally
OL,9,Fdishonest" man, remains on the run in
OL,10,FDubai after stealing more than #33m of
OL,11,Fpublic money.
OL,13,FArif Patel, from Preston in Lancashire,
OL,14,Fwas exposed following a complex
OL,15,Finvestigation spanning years, led by
OL,16,FHis Majesty's Revenue and Customs
OL,17,F(HMRC), which established that he had
OL,18,Ftried to steal as much as #90m.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
