OL,3,GNEWSAWhy a convicted #33m tax fraudster
OL,4,Ais living it up in Dubai
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatel, who skipped the UK in 2011 never
OL,7,Fto return, was eventually convicted in
OL,8,Fhis absence and in 2023 was handed a
OL,9,F20-year prison sentence.
OL,11,FBBC File on 4 Investigates has been on
OL,12,Fthe trail of the man who stole from all
OL,13,Fof us - and seemingly got away with it.
